<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Set Your Password</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">

    ```
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="background-color: #2563eb; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px;">
                Set Your Password
            </h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div style="padding: 40px 30px;">

            <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #333333;">
                Hello <%= name %>,
            </h2>

            <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                You can now set a password for your account and use it to sign in
                with your email address.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                Click the button below to choose a new password for your account.
            </p>

            <!-- Set Password Button -->
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">

                <a href="<%= setPasswordLink %>" style="
                display: inline-block;
                padding: 14px 28px;
                background-color: #2563eb;
                color: #ffffff;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 5px;
                font-size: 16px;
                font-weight: bold;
            ">
                    Set My Password
                </a>

            </div>

            <p style="color: #777777; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                This link will expire in 24 hours for your security.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #777777; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                If you did not expect this email, you can safely ignore it.
                No changes will be made to your account unless you use the link
                to set a password.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #777777; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                For your security, please do not share this link with anyone.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to contact
                our support team.
            </p>

            <p style="color: #333333; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                Thanks,<br />
                The Team
            </p>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #999999; font-size: 12px;">
                © 2026 Your Application. All rights reserved.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
    ```

</body>

</html>